{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 3873464,
  "courseSlug": "nextjs-react-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Next.js & React - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "43356962",
      "title": "Storing Server Actions In Separate Files",
      "lectureOrder": 174,
      "videoOrder": 161,
      "sourceHash": "322035d322ec16c33a0627f11d2ae1cec3ba9e8da6709d08f6ff29c94e3640d6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 3.33,
          "en": "So we're making good progress here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.33,
          "end": 5.61,
          "en": "Before we now work on the file upload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.61,
          "end": 8.04,
          "en": "which is of course the missing piece here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.04,
          "end": 10.77,
          "en": "I wanna come back to that Server Action defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.77,
          "end": 12.843,
          "en": "in that NewPostPage component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.86,
          "end": 18.39,
          "en": "You can define Server Actions like this directly inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.39,
          "end": 19.62,
          "en": "of a component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.62,
          "end": 21.513,
          "en": "There is nothing wrong with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.56,
          "end": 26.88,
          "en": "but you can actually also define them in separate files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.88,
          "end": 30.9,
          "en": "which can also help you avoid component splits",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.9,
          "end": 34.71,
          "en": "as we had to do it here with the separate PostForm component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.71,
          "end": 37.56,
          "en": "because we wanted to use some feature in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.56,
          "end": 40.173,
          "en": "that needed the use client directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.01,
          "end": 43.92,
          "en": "Because of that, we had to create a separate component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.92,
          "end": 45.99,
          "en": "which also is no problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 48.33,
          "en": "but we would not have to do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.33,
          "end": 51.66,
          "en": "if we wouldn't define this Server Action instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.66,
          "end": 53.943,
          "en": "of the NewPostPage component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.9,
          "end": 58.26,
          "en": "Because what you can also do in NextJS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.26,
          "end": 61.53,
          "en": "is you can store those Server Actions in separate files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.53,
          "end": 64.83,
          "en": "And for that I'll add a actions folder here at the root",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.83,
          "end": 69.3,
          "en": "of my next project, though neither the name of this folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.3,
          "end": 72.153,
          "en": "nor the position of the folder matters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 76.14,
          "en": "I'll then add a new file in there, which I'll give any name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.14,
          "end": 78.87,
          "en": "of my choice, for example, posts.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.87,
          "end": 80.733,
          "en": "But again, this does not matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.69,
          "end": 83.7,
          "en": "What does matter now though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.7,
          "end": 88.11,
          "en": "is that you now add use server at the top of this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.11,
          "end": 90.66,
          "en": "So now not inside of a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.66,
          "end": 93.003,
          "en": "but instead at the top of the file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.17,
          "end": 97.41,
          "en": "And then you can grab any Server Action you want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.41,
          "end": 101.61,
          "en": "to outsource, like here, this createPost Server Action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.61,
          "end": 103.72,
          "en": "and cut it from that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.64,
          "end": 108.69,
          "en": "and instead add it here in this posts.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.69,
          "end": 110.043,
          "en": "in the actions folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.36,
          "end": 114.12,
          "en": "And you could now add multiple Server Actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.12,
          "end": 115.65,
          "en": "to that one single file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.65,
          "end": 117.543,
          "en": "You are not limited to one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.62,
          "end": 121.23,
          "en": "You should remove the use server directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.23,
          "end": 123.18,
          "en": "from this function now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.18,
          "end": 125.613,
          "en": "because now we have it at the top of the file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.54,
          "end": 128.28,
          "en": "You only add it inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.28,
          "end": 131.01,
          "en": "of the function if you are creating the function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.01,
          "end": 134.493,
          "en": "as a nested function inside of a component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.69,
          "end": 138.3,
          "en": "And you should add the export keyword here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.3,
          "end": 140.523,
          "en": "to make it available outside of this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.39,
          "end": 144.15,
          "en": "Of course, I'm also using the redirect function in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.15,
          "end": 146.73,
          "en": "so we should also bring over the import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.73,
          "end": 149.25,
          "en": "of that redirect function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 149.25,
          "end": 152.49,
          "en": "And also cut that storePost import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.49,
          "end": 157.23,
          "en": "from the new posts page.js file and add those imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.23,
          "end": 161.55,
          "en": "below the use server directive in the posts.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.55,
          "end": 162.88,
          "en": "in the actions folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.91,
          "end": 168.6,
          "en": "so that these functions are available in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.6,
          "end": 170.4,
          "en": "Well, and now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 170.4,
          "end": 175.4,
          "en": "we can simply import this createPost function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.1,
          "end": 178.503,
          "en": "from the actions folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.46,
          "end": 180.51,
          "en": "And with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.51,
          "end": 184.74,
          "en": "I of course now got a very lean NewPostPage component file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.74,
          "end": 188.37,
          "en": "and we could now bring back the PostForm markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.37,
          "end": 190.29,
          "en": "and logic into this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.29,
          "end": 193.56,
          "en": "But I'll not do that here because it's not important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 193.56,
          "end": 195.33,
          "en": "But we could now do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.33,
          "end": 198.39,
          "en": "We could now turn that into a client component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.39,
          "end": 202.32,
          "en": "because we're now no longer defining the Server Action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.32,
          "end": 203.82,
          "en": "in that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 203.82,
          "end": 207.3,
          "en": "Now here, I won't do it, but we could do it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.3,
          "end": 208.86,
          "en": "And that's therefore another way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.86,
          "end": 211.17000000000002,
          "en": "of managing your Server Actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 211.17000000000002,
          "end": 214.98,
          "en": "And especially as they get more complex and contain more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 214.98,
          "end": 218.22,
          "en": "and more code, or if the surrounding component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.22,
          "end": 220.98,
          "en": "should become a client component, you might want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 220.98,
          "end": 224.04,
          "en": "to consider outsourcing your Server Actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.04,
          "end": 226.893,
          "en": "into a separate file as we're doing it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.73,
          "end": 229.32,
          "en": "With all that done, you'll see that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.32,
          "end": 232.23,
          "en": "of course the form submission still works as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.23,
          "end": 235.53300000000002,
          "en": "it's just a different code structure now, after all.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
